  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The last Steam News post including information about network compatibility was from VRChat 2025.3.4 (October 14, 2025): https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/438100/view/510719798925067188?l=english\n\nEvery update after that has omitted this useful information about network compatibility. For example, 2025.4.1 doesn't mention it: https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/438100/view/667221877701215850?l=english\n\nAs of writing this, VRChat 2026.2.3p3 is live and there hasn't been information since 2025.3.4. The information would be useful for testing bugs.",
